        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 5115KLSSM, Key in L-Square Smooth Lever with Disk Rosette</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Smooth Keyed Lever with Disk Rose is a deluxe keyed lock leverset with a modern feel. This contemporary Key in Smooth Lever with Disk Rosette features the smooth design and a modern round rose. Choose your favorite finish color option with the ability to mix-and-match finishes for seemingly endless possibilities. The  Smooth Keyed Entry Lever with Round Rosette will fit many standard pre-drilled doors. \r\n\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> for the Emtek Smooth Keyed Entry Lever with Round Rosette:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 5-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 1-7/8</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Thickness: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Doors Thickness: 1-1/4\" - 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C</li>\r\n<li>Will fit standard 2-1/8\" door preparations.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Keyed Entry (Keyed Lock):</b> Use when a keyed lock is needed. The lock is operated by a key from the exterior and a thumbturn on the lever from the interior. Complete set - 2 levers, 2 roses, keys, door latch, and strike plate.\r\n<li><b>Dummy:</b> Trim for non-working doors. It does not latch and does not lock. Usually used as matching trim for the non-working side of double doors.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nLevers are Handed. <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Handing Guide</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"left\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-modern-6-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354631\" width=\"512\" height=\"111\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Smooth Keyed Lever with Disk Rose",
                "description": "The Smooth Keyed Lever with Disk Rose is a deluxe keyed lock leverset with a modern feel. This contemporary Key in Smooth Lever with Disk Rosette features the smooth design and a modern round rose. Choose your favorite finish color option with the ability to mix-and-match finishes for seemingly endless possibilities. The  Smooth Keyed Entry Lever with Round Rosette will fit many standard pre-drilled doors.",
